@startuml build-screen-flow
|User|
start
if (Project has a screen flow?) then (no)
  :Choose "Add screen flow";
  |Editor|
  :Create "Screen-flow" with start and stop, and open it;
else (yes)
  |Editor|
  :Open the screen flow;
endif
|User|
:Select an element, branch or empty slot: Up and Down
along the path, Left and Right between branches,
Enter into a decision or loop, Esc out;
if (Action?) then (insert step, decision, loop or stop)
  |Editor|
  if (Can the result be written in activity syntax?) then (yes)
    :Insert at the insertion point, in the lane of the
    element before it; select and focus it;
  else (no)
    :Do not offer the target, or explain why;
  endif
elseif (Action?) then (add or edit a note)
  |Editor|
  :Attach the note to the selected element, or to the
  beginning of the selected branch or loop body;
elseif (Action?) then (move)
  |Editor|
  if (Initial start or final stop?) then (yes)
    :Refuse and explain;
  elseif (Keyboard move at the start or end\nof a branch or loop body?) then (yes)
    :Move nothing; suggest "Move to…";
  else (no)
    :Move it with its notes, keeping its lane;
  endif
elseif (Action?) then (delete)
  |Editor|
  if (Initial start or final stop?) then (yes)
    :Refuse and explain;
  elseif (Decision or loop?) then (yes)
    :Delete it with its contents (undoable), and
    announce what was removed;
  else (no)
    :Delete it (undoable);
  endif
elseif (Action?) then (add or remove a branch)
  |Editor|
  if (Would leave fewer than two branches?) then (yes)
    :Refuse and explain;
  else (no)
    :Add the branch, or remove it with its
    contents (undoable);
  endif
elseif (Action?) then (change lanes)
  |Editor|
  if (Change?) then (add the first lane)
    :Place every existing element in it;
  elseif (Change?) then (delete a lane in use)
    |User|
    :Choose the lane its elements move to;
    |Editor|
    :Move them and delete the lane (undoable);
  elseif (Change?) then (delete the only lane)
    :Return the flow to having no lanes;
  else (set an element's lane, add, rename or reorder)
    :Apply it; only that element's rendered lane changes,
    and renaming updates every element in the lane;
  endif
else (delete the screen flow)
  :Ask for confirmation;
  |User|
  if (Confirm?) then (yes)
    |Editor|
    :Delete it (undoable); the project panel
    shows "Add screen flow" again;
  else (cancel)
    |Editor|
    :Leave the flow unchanged;
  endif
endif
|Editor|
:Update the flow, its source and the preview;
|User|
stop
@enduml
